{
  "_comment": [
    "Seed list of US employer job boards for the HIREWIRE scanner.",
    "",
    "EVERY board in this file was verified live on 2026-09-19 by fetching its API",
    "endpoint and confirming it returned at least one posting. A guessed slug that",
    "404s is the classic failure here: a seed list full of dead boards makes the",
    "whole pipeline look broken. 121 + 83 candidate slugs were probed; the ones",
    "that 404'd or returned an empty board were dropped, not committed.",
    "",
    "Skewed on purpose toward employers that plausibly hire Virginia Tech new",
    "grads -- big tech and data platforms, fintech, defense tech (Anduril, Epirus,",
    "Astranis, Vannevar Labs), and the Northern Virginia / DC cluster (Appian,",
    "Expel, Virtru, Axios) -- so the demo matches the applicant persona without",
    "needing a title filter to fake it.",
    "",
    "api_url is pinned rather than detected: the lifted providers accept an",
    "explicit `api` and skip their careers_url pattern match, which means a",
    "company changing its marketing careers page cannot silently break the scan.",
    "",
    "Not 'all US jobs'. This is a curated list and the pitch must not claim",
    "otherwise (docs/JOB_PIPELINE_PLAN.md section 6.4)."
  ],
